"Exact Linear Time): detection of changepoints with linear computational cost."
"</li></ul>"
msgstr "Method for detecting changepoints:<ul><li>Binary Segmentation: recursively split the データ into segments to detect changepoints.</li><li>PELT (Pruned Exact 線形 Time): detection of changepoints with 線形 computational cost.</li></ul>"

