#: src/frontend/dockwidgets/XYPiecewiseLinearFitCurveDock.cpp:405
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Cost for adding a changepoint. Must be exceeded by the fit improvement (SSE "
"reduction) to justify splitting.\n"
"Lower values detect more changepoints, higher values detect fewer.\n"
"Scale with your data: ~1 for Y-values near 1, ~10-100 for large values, "
"~0.01-0.1 for small values."
msgstr "Cost for adding a changepoint. Must be exceeded by the フィット improvement (SSE reduction) to justify splitting.\nLower 値 detect more changepoints, higher 値 detect fewer.\nScale with your data: ~1 for Y-values near 1, ~10-100 for large values, ~0.01-0.1 for small values."

